<title>USA: Cytyc in pact with LabCorp on pap test.</title>
<headline>Cytyc in pact with LabCorp on pap test.</headline>
<dateline>BOXBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytyc Corp said Thursday it has a contract with Laboratory Corp of America Holdings to make available the Cytyc ThinPrep pap test when requested by LabCorp's physician clients.</p>
<p>LabCorp is the first national laboratory to offer the ThinPrep pat test, it said.</p>
<p>Cytyc develop, makes and markets the ThinPrep system for medical diagnostic applications. The system consists of the ThinPrep 20-00 processor and related reagents, filters, and other supplies, it said.</p>
</text>
